  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultant for Country Strategy Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning (MEL) system - Consultant for the Monitoring and Evaluation service</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Consultant for Country Strategy Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning (MEL) system</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svenska ambassaden i Dhaka har genomf&#xf6;rt ett avrop av st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att g&#xf6;ra de f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringsteorier som tagits fram f&#xf6;r var och ett av strategins st&#xf6;domr&#xe5;den mer uppf&#xf6;ljnings- och utv&#xe4;rderingsbara samt f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;ka l&#xe4;randet. Dessutom avropades st&#xf6;d i framtagandet av en uppf&#xf6;ljnings- och utv&#xe4;rderingsplan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Development Cooperation Section at the Swedish Embassy in Dhaka is endeavoring to enhance the quality of its work with monitoring, evaluation and learning. This Assignment is part of the operationalisation of Sweden&#x2019;s Development Cooperation Strategy with Bangladesh 2021-2025, and concerns an evaluation-related service to support the Embassy revisit the ToCs developed during the initial strategy plan development to make them easier to  monitor and evaluate. The consultant is expected to support the development of a robust structure for systematic use of evidence, evaluations, and other types of analysis. The purpose is to help Sida continuously assess progress, evaluate and learn in order to support strategic decision making throughout the strategy implementation. Therefore, in addition to supporting the refinement of the existing ToCs, support is also needed for the development of plans for monitoring, evaluation and learning. These plans shall be based on the refined ToCs and be synchronized with Sida&#x2019;s reporting cycle.</narrative>
  </description>
